      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Messages ignorés"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ignored lines still show in the log, as debug lines, but never count as warnings or errors or send alerts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les lignes ignorées restent dans le journal, comme lignes de débogage, mais ne comptent jamais comme avertissements ou erreurs et n’envoient pas d’alertes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dans"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inbox": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Boîte de réception"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It aborted (SIGABRT), usually after a failed check in its own code.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il s’est interrompu (SIGABRT), souvent après une vérification échouée dans son propre code."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It crashed (segmentation fault).": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il a planté (erreur de segmentation)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It failed the last %lld health checks in a row.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il a échoué aux %lld derniers contrôles de santé d’affilée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It failed the last health check.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il a échoué au dernier contrôle de santé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It started %lld times in 10 minutes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il a démarré %lld fois en 10 minutes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It stops answering until you start it again. Anything that depends on it stops working too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il ne répond plus jusqu’à ce que vous le redémarriez. Tout ce qui en dépend cesse aussi de fonctionner."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It was killed (SIGKILL): docker stop timed out, or the system ran out of memory.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il a été tué (SIGKILL) : docker stop a dépassé le délai, ou le système a manqué de mémoire."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its command couldn't run: it isn't executable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sa commande n’a pas pu s’exécuter : elle n’est pas exécutable."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its command wasn't found in the image.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
