    "Test Connection": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tester la connexion"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app stopped with an error. Its last messages say why.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’app s’est arrêtée sur une erreur. Ses derniers messages disent pourquoi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The container used more memory than it's allowed. Raise its memory limit or find what grows.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le conteneur a utilisé plus de mémoire que permis. Augmentez sa limite de mémoire ou trouvez ce qui grossit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The containers of %@ haven't logged anything yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les conteneurs de %@ n’ont encore rien écrit dans leur journal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The merged log of %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le journal combiné de %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The same alert comes at most every 15 minutes. Click a notification to see the container's log.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La même alerte arrive au plus toutes les 15 minutes. Cliquez sur une notification pour voir le journal du conteneur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The token stays in your keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le jeton reste dans votre trousseau."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They stop counting as problems in the overview and in alerts, and show dimmed here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ils ne comptent plus comme problèmes dans l’aperçu et les alertes, et apparaissent estompés ici."
          }
        }
      }
    },
